      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.7,
          "en": "So let's now work on the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.7,
          "end": 4.533,
          "en": "we need here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.533,
          "end": 8.06,
          "en": "And I'm going to start with the coach items here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.06,
          "end": 10.21,
          "en": "For that I wanna use a separate component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.21,
          "end": 13.76,
          "en": "because we'll have quite a lot of markup and styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.76,
          "end": 17.26,
          "en": "related to this part, related to this list items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.26,
          "end": 20.23,
          "en": "and I don't wanna put that all into coach's list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.23,
          "end": 22.48,
          "en": "even though that of course would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.48,
          "end": 24.27,
          "en": "I mean, technically you can build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.27,
          "end": 27.24,
          "en": "an entire Vue app with just one component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.24,
          "end": 30.5,
          "en": "but the idea behind components is to split your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.5,
          "end": 33.31,
          "en": "into smaller reusable pieces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.31,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "Therefore, in components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 38.12,
          "en": "I'll add a new sub-folder, coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.12,
          "end": 42.46,
          "en": "where all the coach-related components should go in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.46,
          "end": 46.053,
          "en": "For example, the CoachItem.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.86,
          "end": 51.43,
          "en": "Now, in this CoachItem.vue file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.43,
          "end": 53.85,
          "en": "I want to define my template, which is a list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.85,
          "end": 55.57,
          "en": "or which holds a list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.57,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "And in there, I now wanna output all that coach data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 63.53,
          "en": "For example, in a h3 tag, the name of the coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.53,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "Here, I will interpolate the full name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 68.53999999999999,
          "en": "And this doesn't exist yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.53999999999999,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "but we'll add the logic to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.553,
          "en": "we will have such a full name property at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.5,
          "end": 76.85300000000001,
          "en": "Then below that, a h4 tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.68,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "and I recommend that you use the same tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 84.19,
          "en": "so that the styling which I provide works for you as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.19,
          "end": 85.64,
          "en": "Technically, of course, you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.64,
          "end": 88.6,
          "en": "any tags you want and any structure you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.6,
          "end": 91.63,
          "en": "but here in the h4 tag, I wanna output dollar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.63,
          "end": 94.25999999999999,
          "en": "then the rate which we get for this coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.25999999999999,
          "end": 98.763,
          "en": "/hour to show the rate this coach charges.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.53999999999999,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "Then I will actually add a div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "where I wanna output the areas of expertise of that coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "Because the dummy data I gave you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 113.57,
          "en": "already has this areas property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.57,
          "end": 117.22,
          "en": "which holds an array with some clearly defined keys,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.22,
          "end": 120.17,
          "en": "frontend, backend, and career,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.17,
          "end": 121.86,
          "en": "which are the areas of expertise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.86,
          "end": 123.423,
          "en": "I wanna support in this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.51,
          "end": 126.98,
          "en": "where a coach can be an expert.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.98,
          "end": 129.07,
          "en": "I'm an expert in all these areas, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.07,
          "end": 132.243,
          "en": "Julie, for example, is an expert in career and frontend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.81,
          "end": 137.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I wanna output that here in CoachItem in that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.92000000000002,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "Here, I wanna go through these areas",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "and render a batch for every area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 147.41,
          "en": "so to show which areas of expertise this coach has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.41,
          "end": 150.38,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll simply add a span here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.38,
          "end": 155.38,
          "en": "and add v-for on that to go through the area in areas,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.5,
          "end": 159.35,
          "en": "so to go through all the areas of expertise of a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.35,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "add the key, which is the area itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 164.85,
          "en": "because it's unique anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.85,
          "end": 168.85,
          "en": "a coach can't be an expert in the same area twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.85,
          "end": 171.59300000000002,
          "en": "And I then simply want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.6,
          "end": 176.163,
          "en": "for the moment, output my area like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 180.56,
          "en": "This will also become a separate component in the future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.56,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "but for the moment I'll leave it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 187.82,
          "en": "And then below that I'll have a div with a class of actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.33,
          "end": 193.33,
          "en": "where I wanna render two buttons in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.33,
          "end": 195.73,
          "en": "or two links, we could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.73,
          "end": 199.31,
          "en": "One to contact the coach, and to, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.31,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "go to this contact route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "and one to view the details of a coach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 206.653,
          "en": "and go to this detail route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.69,
          "end": 211.563,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll add a router link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.84,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "like this, and on the first router link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 220.85,
          "en": "we're going to go to /coaches/ and then the coach ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.72,
          "end": 225.17000000000002,
          "en": "So that should be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 227.24,
          "en": "For the moment I'll hard-code it though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.24,
          "end": 230.69,
          "en": "/contact and say Contact here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.69,
          "end": 233.78,
          "en": "And the second link will then show us the details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.78,
          "end": 236.02,
          "en": "so I will say View Details here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 236.02,
          "end": 240.563,
          "en": "and there, I wanna go to just /coaches/ that coach ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 243.37,
          "en": "Again, I'll soon make this dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.37,
          "end": 246.203,
          "en": "because, of course, the ID shouldn't be hard-coded here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.3,
          "end": 249.4,
          "en": "That's the general markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.4,
          "end": 250.96,
          "en": "Now, for the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.96,
          "end": 254.3,
          "en": "we're going to use some scoped CSS style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.3,
          "end": 257.45,
          "en": "and attached you'll find the Coach Item CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.45,
          "end": 259.75,
          "en": "which contains those prepared styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.75,
          "end": 262.603,
          "en": "which you can simply paste between your style tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.4,
          "end": 268.99,
          "en": "And with that added, we can add a script here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.99,
          "end": 272.25,
          "en": "and now make sure that this coach item works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.25,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "The plan is to use this coach item in a coach list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.7,
          "end": 277.793,
          "en": "So we will receive all the data we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.793,
          "end": 279.83,
          "en": "through props in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.83,
          "end": 282.68,
          "en": "because we're going to render the coach item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.68,
          "end": 284.76,
          "en": "Here we have all the coach data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.76,
          "end": 287.14,
          "en": "so we can then pass the coach data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.14,
          "end": 290.68,
          "en": "which we need in coach item, through props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.68,
          "end": 292.08,
          "en": "And we would do it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.08,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "because the data for a specific coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 296.8,
          "en": "especially in such a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.8,
          "end": 300.04,
          "en": "is of course not managed with Vuex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 300.04,
          "end": 303.65,
          "en": "This is not application wide state or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.65,
          "end": 307.04,
          "en": "It's really just internal local state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 307.04,
          "end": 310.34,
          "en": "in this loop here, in this v-for loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.34,
          "end": 313.483,
          "en": "And therefore that is a clear case for props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.78,
          "end": 317.46,
          "en": "Hence here we'll get some props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.46,
          "end": 319.42,
          "en": "and I want the ID of the coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 319.42,
          "end": 322.83,
          "en": "we need that to construct this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.83,
          "end": 326.693,
          "en": "I want the first name and the last name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 328.13,
          "end": 332.013,
          "en": "I want to have the rate and the areas of expertise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.55,
          "end": 336.73,
          "en": "And then we can add a couple of computed properties here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336.73,
          "end": 338.74,
          "en": "to make our life easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.74,
          "end": 341.02,
          "en": "For example, for the full name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 341.02,
          "end": 344.343,
          "en": "which of course is a combination of first and last name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 345.19,
          "end": 348.78,
          "en": "for that, I'll add a full name computed property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 348.78,
          "end": 353.78,
          "en": "and return this.firstName + a blank + this.lastName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 355.08,
          "end": 356.93,
          "en": "but also maybe for those links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.93,
          "end": 359.59000000000003,
          "en": "which shouldn't be hard-coded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.59000000000003,
          "end": 362.257,
          "en": "Here we could add a coachContactLink",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 364.27,
          "end": 367.23,
          "en": "computed property, where we return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.05,
          "end": 375.05,
          "en": "/coaches/ and then the ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 377.26,
          "end": 379.82,
          "en": "So this ID refers to this ID prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 379.82,
          "end": 383.32,
          "en": "which we're getting, plus /contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 383.32,
          "end": 385.09,
          "en": "This will then construct a path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 385.09,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "like /coaches/c1/contact, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 391.43,
          "end": 395.37,
          "en": "and another computed property, the coachDetailsLink,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 397.25,
          "end": 402.25,
          "en": "where I wanna return /coaches/ then again the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 404.36,
          "end": 407.08,
          "en": "but then slash nothing, because here we just want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 407.08,
          "end": 409.733,
          "en": "to go to something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 411.5,
          "end": 414.1,
          "en": "Now we can also replace /coaches here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.1,
          "end": 416.81,
          "en": "if we want to, it's not necessary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 416.81,
          "end": 419.49,
          "en": "but to make this component a bit more flexible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 419.49,
          "end": 422.8,
          "en": "in case we should ever change this /coaches path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 422.8,
          "end": 426.467,
          "en": "to a different one, we can use this.$route.path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 426.467,
          "end": 430.56,
          "en": "+ '/' to use whatever the current path is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 430.56,
          "end": 433.683,
          "en": "as a starting point to then build a longer path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 434.68,
          "end": 437.69,
          "en": "This is totally optional,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
